{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOListItemAvatar","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemAvatar","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" displays a circular visual identifier that can represent a user, a contact,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or any entity. It supports three content types: a predefined icon, a custom image, or text initials.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"An optional ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBadgeStandard","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBadgeIcon","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" can be attached at the bottom-trailing corner to indicate status.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Avatar-types","level":2,"text":"Avatar types","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemAvatar\/AvatarType","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" enum defines the content displayed inside the avatar:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".icon","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined person\/people icon from the current theme’s resource bundle.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".image(_:)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A custom "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Image"},{"type":"text","text":" asset that fills the avatar circle."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".initials(_:)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A short text string (2 characters maximum) rendered centered in the avatar."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Sizes","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Sizes"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemAvatar\/Size","type":"reference"},{"text":" enum defines the available sizes for the avatar:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".medium","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The default size, suited for standard list items."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".large"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A larger variant for increased visual prominence."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".extraLarge"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The largest variant, typically used for profile-like displays.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" When the avatar is embedded in a list item with small size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(via "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/SwiftUICore\/View\/misoListItemSize(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":"), the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"size"},{"text":" parameter is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"ignored","type":"text"}]},{"type":